  <item>
    <title>新疆自驾！赛里木湖到底白不白活啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a169efc5dd1cf2331be3e6a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a169efc5dd1cf2331be3e6a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 09:06:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五一自驾伊犁小环线9日体验卡，滴！</span></p><p><span>本次五人朋友团从乌鲁木齐出发，走逆时针方向到达赛里木湖向南，沿伊犁草原方向折返。</span></p><p><span>天气理想，连吃带玩，心情愉快，也想去玩的朋友欢迎提问交流~</span></p><p><span>【公众号】</span></p><p><span>朋友之间Podcast</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">00:04:05</a> 路况和路线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">00:05:44</a> 三小时时差带来的超长活动时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">00:19:13</a> &nbsp;逆时针走小环线的沿途景观</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">00:22:50</a> 天气和气温，库尔德宁骑马体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">00:33:40</a> 赛里木湖好在哪儿，唯一踩雷高白鲑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3276">00:54:36</a> 厕所、防晒和空气湿度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3614">01:00:14</a>  骑马一时爽，屁股火葬场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">01:03:20</a>&nbsp; 夜宿八卦城奇遇记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4608">01:16:48</a>&nbsp;  吃了什么好东西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5895">01:38:15</a>&nbsp; 218公路体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6035">01:40:35</a>&nbsp; 统计花销</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>Sandy | 东东 | Tia | 一堵墙</span></p><p><span>【本期配乐】</span></p><p><span>白色的波浪——沙依拉西·加尔木哈买提</span></p>]]></description>
