  <item>
    <title>跟朋友过年！一波三折的西班牙之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d0a7a8b977fb2c47140af6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d0a7a8b977fb2c47140af6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2026年的春节假期，Sandy和东东决定再次一起出国旅行。</span></p><p><span>她们各自带上了自己的同事组成了五人小队，飞往明媚热情的西班牙，准备在那里度过14天的假期。没想到天气上来就给了她们一记下马威，又遭到了交通和餐饮的轮番痛打。</span></p><p><span>你将在这期节目中听到以下精彩内容：没带现金和信用卡如何畅游西班牙；交通卡消磁了怎么办；食物中毒的严重程度及治疗办法；控制酒瘾患者境外狂饮的必要性。</span></p><p><span>祝大家出境游不会踏入同一条河流。</span></p><p><span>【公众号】</span></p><p><span>朋友之间Podcast</span></p><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;躺平旅游计划，14天只玩西班牙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;酒蒙子当天喝醉，没带现金和信用卡怎么在欧洲生活两周</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;环西班牙行程路线介绍，气候灾害影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;全面难吃的马德里食物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;餐饮便利店营业情况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;15日公交卡惨遭消磁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;住贵价酒店吃到上吐下泻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;西班牙高铁大吐槽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2278">37:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;体验狂欢节——撒糖节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;错过厕所的后果</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;小米手机遭遇APP更新危机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">54:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;寄存行李难上加难，服务人员全员伪人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">1:04:45</a> 酒蒙子再次记大过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4205">1:10:05</a> 古板售票员再次出现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4447">1:14:07</a> 公共交通导致行程永远在推迟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4666">1:17:46</a> 出行花销统计</span></p><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><p><span>Sandy | 东东 | Tia | 昱 | 一堵墙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ccc1c9d5ac72e6e3402ab7/lqazd5y-A-v1DehrJ2ghQOFwtW8e.m4a" length="77480072" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:46</itunes:duration>
