  <item>
    <title>国庆出游！海南岛与长白山之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69301ece3fec3166cf12b80e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69301ece3fec3166cf12b80e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 12:09:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>避开了人群避不开极端天气……</span></p><span></span><p><span>国庆错峰出游的我们分别遭遇了海南的台风和长白山的雨雪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tia和一堵墙在三亚连续两天直面台风博罗伊，东东与Sandy连续三天遇到天池景区封锁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是面对不那么理想的天气我们依然有不错的体验，我们一起聊聊十一期间在这两个经典旅游目的地怎么玩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【公众号】</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友之间Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;白山机场打车难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;住在景区里的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;三种不同的泡汤场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;运动员村奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Sandy首次东北搓澡体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;白村盗墓笔记主题民宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;到三亚惨遭台风夹击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;海南食物测评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3337">55:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;陵水吃住推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4062">1:07:42</a> 海南东线自驾体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">1:08:33</a> 去海南为什么不推荐溯溪鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4295">1:11:35</a> &nbsp;东北吃饭体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sandy | 东东 | Tia | 一堵墙 | 昱（已睡着）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>大东北我的家乡（爵士版）——梨茗子/一只狗咬猫</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ccc1c9d5ac72e6e3402ab7/lhRwcSOE3xlf3BIynXoHuPAIoT8A.m4a" length="76955483" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:13</itunes:duration>
