    <guid isPermaLink="false">6722448133c798676f3404b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 15:56:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小兴安岭长啥样？十一假期去东北自驾游好玩吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年的国庆假期，Tia和一堵墙临时决定租车去小兴安岭环线，去看秋天的东北山林。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从哈尔滨出发，一路经过伊春、五营、汤旺、逊克和五大连池，我们看到了期待中的黄叶，和未曾想到的其他一切。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也对小兴安岭感到好奇，或者也在筹备一次东北自驾之旅，不妨来听一听我们的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在公众号整理了一些出行信息和照片，大家可以边看边听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【公众号】</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友之间Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;突发奇想自驾小兴安岭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;哈尔滨魔幻烧烤体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;伊春的风景吃喝与住宿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;看鹿之旅——金山鹿苑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;爬不上去但打水漂友好的金祖峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;神奇美食小镇——五营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">50:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;五营森林公园喜出望外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;汤旺河林海奇石景区的超绝生态环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3645">1:00:45</a> 黄金周找不到地方住只能连夜走惊天土路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4505">1:15:05</a> 长途奔袭五大连池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4906">1:21:46</a> 去了不后悔的温泊和格拉球山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6275">1:44:35</a> 去东北自驾游的难点和推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sandy | 东东 | Tia | 一堵墙</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>自己人——雪村</span></p>]]></description>
