    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知道你有没有过独自去酒馆的冲动，想要一边小酌一边听别人聊天，但是并不想加入讨论。来试试我们的边喝边录的这一期，你可以当做是深夜正好走进我们的家庭小酒馆，听听故事，一起喝一起笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>记得把这一期分享给你最想一起喝酒的人听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【公众号】</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友之间Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;一边按摩仪按背一边开酒的昱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;道士为什么要带江小白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;东东的断片跟别人不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Sandy的老师爬山失温靠酒支撑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;把啤酒当水喝结果越喝越多的东东</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;喝酒治疗失眠但是失败了的昱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不爱喝但是可以喝的Tia</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;成年当天第一次喝酒就是白酒的Sandy</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从小什么都喝过但是都不喜欢的一堵墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;社交场合的喝酒真麻烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;假酒导致的恶心故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sandy | 昱 | 东东 | Tia | 一堵墙</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Red Red Wine——UB40</span></p>]]></description>
